    'dlp.linux3': 'No auto-update; the fairy opens the releases page when a new version is out',
    'dlp.aiT': 'Connect an AI (optional)',
    'dlp.ai': 'Install and sign in to one of Claude Code (<code>claude</code>), Codex (<code>codex</code>), Cursor (<code>cursor-agent</code>) or Gemini (<code>gemini</code>) and it shows as “installed, signed in” in the chat window. No AI tool? Pick “Free AI” in the chat window to download one.',
    'dlp.fileT': 'A fairy from a friend',
    'dlp.file': 'Got a <code>{petFileExt}</code> file from a friend? Once {name} is installed, double-click it to bring that fairy home, or use Settings → Data → Import fairy.',
